{"recordId":"general_林仁肇_905210854","name":"林仁肇","type":"general","dynasty":"五代十國","title":"南唐柱石","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"林仁肇","pageId":524250,"revisionId":91851499,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-03-12T02:52:57Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9E%97%E4%BB%81%E8%82%87","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91851499","wikidataId":"Q11105448","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"續資治通鑒","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:36:07.511Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:xinwudaishi","source:jiuwudaishi","source:songshi","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:xinwudaishi-c4ad7e378aff1fd3","query":"林仁肇","count":1,"offset":4580,"excerpt":"皮囊布鐵蒺藜于地。周兵見而知其怯，一鼓敗之。世宗營于淝水之陽，徙浮橋于下蔡。景遣林仁肇等爭之不得，而周師取滁州。景懼，遣泗州牙將王知朗至徐州，稱唐皇帝奉書，願効貢賦，陳兄事之禮，世宗不答。景東都副留守馮延魯、光州刺史張紹、舒州刺史周祚、泰州刺史方","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jiuwudaishi-743ae36606ec158d","query":"林仁肇","count":1,"offset":5423,"excerpt":"監行用。殿前都指揮使張永德奏，破淮賊於下蔡。先是，江南李景以王師猶在壽州，遣其將林仁肇、郭廷謂率水陸軍至下蔡，欲奪浮梁，以舟實薪芻，乘風縱火，永德禦之。有頃，風勢倒指，賊眾稍卻，因為官軍所敗。己卯，工部侍郎王敏停任，坐薦子婿陳南金為河陽記室也。\n","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-2b1b92d7f82bfc78","query":"林仁肇","count":1,"offset":7508,"excerpt":"以周師在壽春攻圍日急，又恃水戰，乃大發樓船蔽江而下，泊於濠、泗，周師頗不利。吳將林仁肇帥眾千餘，水陸齊進，又以船數艘載薪，乘風縱火，將焚周浮梁，周人憂之。俄而風反，吳人稍卻，永德進兵敗之。又夜使習水者沒其船下，縻以鐵鎖，引輕舠急擊。吳人既不得進，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-8275febc03617eb4","query":"林仁肇","count":2,"offset":2412,"excerpt":"承祐詣泉、建召募驍勇，承祐薦前永安節度使許文稹、靜江指揮使陳德誠、建州人鄭彥華、林仁肇。唐主以文稹為西面行營應援使，彥華、仁肇皆為將。仁肇，仁翰之弟也。\n\n夏，四月，甲子，以侍衛新軍都指揮使、歸德節度使李重進為廬、壽等州招討使，以武寧節度使武行德","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:xinwudaishi-c4ad7e378aff1fd3","bookId":"book:xinwudaishi","requestedTitle":"新五代史/卷62","title":"新五代史/卷62","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B762","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1674689","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B762?action=history","revisionId":1674689,"revisionTimestamp":"2019-08-05T13:44:09Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:55:03.977Z","sha256":"99cb909a5c2497a5b83d620de75fcff73f14bf3632a0dbd001bdcc8226a7c0f6","textSha256":"efb088a35514e97560ea75bc6af2607af76089c657b72807c5adb74be0524996","expandedWikitextSha256":"99cb909a5c2497a5b83d620de75fcff73f14bf3632a0dbd001bdcc8226a7c0f6","characters":8609,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/xinwudaishi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:40.430Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 50% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/fc0625dcbd82ba1527a8.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/fc0625dcbd82ba1527a8.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:jiuwudaishi-743ae36606ec158d","bookId":"book:jiuwudaishi","requestedTi